, and high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create playlists, share them, and explore dynamic daily levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a live Discord community — speedrunners, streamers, and creators united</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show off your skills. Share your worlds. Become a DASH legend.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "Dash, jump, and blast through hundreds of community-made 2D platforming challenges. Fast-paced, explosive action meets creative speedrunning!",
