        "reviews": "“What is DASH: Danger Action Speed Heroes? If you like a lot of Super Meat Boy and speed running levels then this is for you.”<br>Opium Pulses<br><br>“I've had a lot of fun with the previous builds of the game and there's now a ridiculous amount of levels available to it, some made by the developer and plenty others by actual players. It's pretty damn impressive really!”<br>GamingOnLinux<br><br>“DASH really impresses with its great platforming physics, an endless supply of community created content and the ability to easily build and share your own deviously designed levels.”<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br>",
